From 2884cc67bd1d734a5f4d7f37bcff8db1862221cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:01:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Heart only: the phone's and the browser's voices go, and
 the Voice sheet with them (tests follow)

His word of 2026-11-16, about 22:35 UTC: "remove locally LLM voices ...
(only leave one the standard prerecorded voices)". Listen stands only
where Heart's recording is: a chapter of the English Bible by
lib/readAloud/chapters.ts (the New Testament today), a library text by
lib/listen/recordings.ts (none yet), never over a downloaded Bible.
lib/listen/speech/ is gone, the audio store has no spoken session, the
player's steps and Now Playing know no spoken address, and the Voice
sheet, its mount and the player's Voice row are gone. The native
PurifySpeech files and their registration are untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VuYTwaMDRMVE18BeTfEz4w
